1
00:00:09,050 --> 00:00:11,030
(Supported by NRTA's Online Audiovisual
Quality Creation & Distribution Project)

2
00:00:24,540 --> 00:00:29,530
♪Black hair twines around bone♪

3
00:00:29,700 --> 00:00:35,360
♪Night dew cold♪

4
00:00:35,480 --> 00:00:39,740
♪Bronze mirror cracks
through three lifetimes♪

5
00:00:40,480 --> 00:00:44,030
♪Shines on the sleepless♪

6
00:00:44,140 --> 00:00:48,580
♪Yunmeng Marsh ebbs and flows♪

7
00:00:49,050 --> 00:00:52,730
♪Vows sink deep♪

8
00:00:52,840 --> 00:00:58,350
♪White-hair curse turns to snow♪

9
00:00:58,390 --> 00:01:03,160
♪Covering the realm♪

10
00:01:07,520 --> 00:01:11,020
=Reunion Across Time=

11
00:01:11,060 --> 00:01:14,080
=Episode 13=

12
00:01:31,160 --> 00:01:32,880
You dared to lure me out?

13
00:01:33,560 --> 00:01:35,640
Seems you want to die
in those men's place too.

14
00:01:36,680 --> 00:01:38,120
What manner of demon are you?

15
00:01:40,360 --> 00:01:43,040
I hate all the faithless men
in this world.

16
00:01:43,720 --> 00:01:45,320
I was once a palace singer.

17
00:01:46,280 --> 00:01:47,840
I wanted to elope with my love,

18
00:01:48,320 --> 00:01:50,080
but he abandoned me without a thought.

19
00:01:51,840 --> 00:01:53,520
In the end, my long hair was cut off,

20
00:01:53,520 --> 00:01:54,960
and I starved to death in the palace.

21
00:01:55,680 --> 00:01:57,840
All I could do was
possess this music score.

22
00:01:59,120 --> 00:02:00,240
I hate them!

23
00:02:00,720 --> 00:02:01,680
I hate them!

24
00:02:02,760 --> 00:02:03,720
But not everyone in this world

25
00:02:03,920 --> 00:02:05,880
is so heartless.

26
00:02:06,720 --> 00:02:08,480
You hurt people without caring
whether they're good or bad.

27
00:02:09,080 --> 00:02:10,280
How are you any different from them?

28
00:02:14,160 --> 00:02:15,600
He betrayed me.

29
00:02:16,440 --> 00:02:17,920
The whole world betrayed me.

30
00:02:18,880 --> 00:02:20,520
As long as I exist,

31
00:02:21,240 --> 00:02:22,800
I'll never spare them!

32
00:02:32,760 --> 00:02:34,080
I'll kill you!

33
00:03:28,040 --> 00:03:29,800
I don't think this is so simple.

34
00:03:30,680 --> 00:03:31,560
Wait until it burns out.

35
00:03:31,760 --> 00:03:32,800
Then we'll come back
and see what happens.

36
00:03:33,680 --> 00:03:34,160
All right.

37
00:03:34,320 --> 00:03:34,920
Let's go.

38
00:03:58,160 --> 00:03:59,600
Just as I thought,
there's a bamboo slip here.

39
00:04:02,640 --> 00:04:04,160
Just like the two we found earlier.

40
00:04:05,760 --> 00:04:08,120
Who on earth is luring demons
to do evil in this city?

41
00:04:10,120 --> 00:04:11,480
Let's go back and check on Xizhao first.

42
00:04:12,480 --> 00:04:13,160
Let's go.

43
00:04:25,280 --> 00:04:26,760
You're back.

44
00:04:38,480 --> 00:04:39,800
How can this be?

45
00:04:42,560 --> 00:04:43,960
How can this be?

46
00:04:54,920 --> 00:04:56,040
Miss Chu Li,

47
00:04:56,760 --> 00:04:58,280
you must have a way

48
00:04:58,920 --> 00:05:00,640
to change me back,

49
00:05:01,240 --> 00:05:02,040
right?

50
00:05:02,720 --> 00:05:04,240
I don't want Qin Lang to wake up

51
00:05:04,400 --> 00:05:05,800
and see me like this.

52
00:05:06,360 --> 00:05:07,040
I...

53
00:05:07,800 --> 00:05:08,880
I don't want this.

54
00:05:10,680 --> 00:05:11,400
All right.

55
00:05:14,840 --> 00:05:15,640
I can

56
00:05:16,240 --> 00:05:17,240
make you young again.

57
00:05:48,280 --> 00:05:49,680
I look like myself again!

58
00:05:50,720 --> 00:05:51,880
I look like myself again!

59
00:05:52,840 --> 00:05:53,760
Xizhao.

60
00:05:57,120 --> 00:05:57,920
Qin Lang?

61
00:06:05,880 --> 00:06:06,720
Qin Lang,

62
00:06:07,920 --> 00:06:09,320
you're finally awake.

63
00:06:11,200 --> 00:06:12,560
I missed you so much.

64
00:06:14,160 --> 00:06:15,880
I really missed you so much.

65
00:06:17,720 --> 00:06:18,560
Xizhao,

66
00:06:20,600 --> 00:06:22,040
we'll never be apart again.

67
00:06:46,720 --> 00:06:47,800
Almost all her blood essence

68
00:06:48,680 --> 00:06:50,040
has been drained.

69
00:06:52,280 --> 00:06:53,680
There's no saving her now.

70
00:06:55,480 --> 00:06:56,600
I can't save her,

71
00:06:57,680 --> 00:06:59,320
nor her Qin Lang.

72
00:07:02,880 --> 00:07:04,400
All I could give her was a dream.

73
00:07:19,160 --> 00:07:20,200
Her Qin Lang

74
00:07:21,000 --> 00:07:22,080
went with her.

75
00:07:40,180 --> 00:07:42,980
(Tomb of Xizhao and Qin Lang)

76
00:07:43,680 --> 00:07:44,800
Maybe it's better this way.

77
00:07:45,320 --> 00:07:46,640
They can be together now.

78
00:07:48,400 --> 00:07:49,480
Life is short.

79
00:07:50,120 --> 00:07:50,840
They thought

80
00:07:50,960 --> 00:07:53,000
they could grow old
with the one they loved,

81
00:07:54,600 --> 00:07:56,280
never knowing how suddenly

82
00:07:57,000 --> 00:07:58,080
everything could change.

83
00:07:59,640 --> 00:08:01,040
They couldn't be together in life.

84
00:08:01,880 --> 00:08:03,120
Saying they're reunited in death

85
00:08:04,200 --> 00:08:06,160
only comforts the living.

86
00:08:41,840 --> 00:08:42,800
What are you looking at?

87
00:08:44,040 --> 00:08:45,040
Do you think

88
00:08:45,720 --> 00:08:46,840
what I said makes sense?

89
00:08:49,040 --> 00:08:50,160
I think you're right.

90
00:08:50,840 --> 00:08:51,880
Life is short.

91
00:08:52,320 --> 00:08:53,400
Seize the day.

92
00:08:54,320 --> 00:08:55,160
So...

93
00:08:56,000 --> 00:08:57,360
And?

94
00:09:04,520 --> 00:09:05,400
Let's go back.

95
00:09:08,840 --> 00:09:09,560
All right.

96
00:09:16,500 --> 00:09:20,580
(Song Residence)

97
00:09:33,760 --> 00:09:34,280
Chu Li,

98
00:09:34,520 --> 00:09:35,680
let me tell you something fun.

99
00:09:35,880 --> 00:09:36,880
Don't talk to me.

100
00:09:38,760 --> 00:09:39,480
Chu Li,

101
00:09:39,920 --> 00:09:42,000
you've been off ever since you came back
with Diviner Song.

102
00:09:43,360 --> 00:09:44,680
Did you two have a fight?

103
00:09:45,280 --> 00:09:46,120
A fight?

104
00:09:46,440 --> 00:09:47,480
What's there to fight about?

105
00:09:48,200 --> 00:09:49,160
No, something's off.

106
00:09:50,120 --> 00:09:52,040
You've been listless for days.

107
00:09:52,320 --> 00:09:53,040
And besides,

108
00:09:54,080 --> 00:09:56,480
you and Diviner Song haven't
seen each other in days, have you?

109
00:09:57,080 --> 00:09:58,720
Why are you so talkative?

110
00:09:59,080 --> 00:10:00,240
Can you let me have some peace?

111
00:10:01,520 --> 00:10:02,840
I just don't want you to be bored.

112
00:10:02,960 --> 00:10:03,640
Shiqi.

113
00:10:04,280 --> 00:10:05,080
Why are you calling him?

114
00:10:06,560 --> 00:10:07,360
Miss Chu Li.

115
00:10:08,640 --> 00:10:10,480
Didn't you want to
take me as your master?

116
00:10:11,400 --> 00:10:13,160
Learn martial arts properly from Shiqi
first.

117
00:10:13,600 --> 00:10:14,560
Shiqi, take him out.

118
00:10:14,640 --> 00:10:15,720
Chu Li, I don't want to
learn martial arts.

119
00:10:16,400 --> 00:10:17,880
Wait, aren't you
Diviner Song's subordinate?

120
00:10:18,320 --> 00:10:19,360
Why are you listening to her?

121
00:10:23,840 --> 00:10:25,400
(Why think so much about it?)

122
00:10:26,000 --> 00:10:27,320
(My first priority now)

123
00:10:27,440 --> 00:10:28,720
(is to become Grand Shaman.)

124
00:10:29,040 --> 00:10:30,880
(Then I won't have to
see Song Ziyuan every day.)

125
00:10:36,040 --> 00:10:36,680
(Master,)

126
00:10:37,160 --> 00:10:38,720
(the singer Lanruo
that Xizhao mentioned)

127
00:10:38,800 --> 00:10:39,720
(is now in the palace.)

128
00:10:40,160 --> 00:10:41,280
(She's now Beautiful Lady Lan.)

129
00:10:43,440 --> 00:10:44,280
Get everything ready.

130
00:10:45,240 --> 00:10:46,040
I'm going to the palace.

131
00:10:46,320 --> 00:10:46,920
(Yes.)

132
00:11:03,440 --> 00:11:04,520
Why are you dressed like that?

133
00:11:05,360 --> 00:11:06,640
Aren't you going to the palace?

134
00:11:07,920 --> 00:11:09,160
What are you going there for?

135
00:11:09,720 --> 00:11:10,560
Go back now.

136
00:11:11,240 --> 00:11:12,200
I'm going no matter what.

137
00:11:13,000 --> 00:11:13,640
Either

138
00:11:13,960 --> 00:11:15,680
I go with you openly,

139
00:11:16,280 --> 00:11:16,920
or

140
00:11:17,080 --> 00:11:18,480
I sneak in on my own.

141
00:11:20,560 --> 00:11:21,880
If I get caught...

142
00:11:25,880 --> 00:11:26,600
This way.

143
00:11:37,880 --> 00:11:39,440
Right this way, Diviner Song.

144
00:11:46,040 --> 00:11:47,760
(Who knows how long I'll have to wait?)

145
00:11:48,360 --> 00:11:50,080
(But I never entered the palace
in my previous life.)

146
00:11:50,240 --> 00:11:52,120
(This time, at least I get to see it.)

147
00:12:03,620 --> 00:12:06,340
(Lanruo)

148
00:12:16,680 --> 00:12:17,640
Who's this?

149
00:12:18,320 --> 00:12:20,000
This is Diviner Song's attendant.

150
00:12:21,040 --> 00:12:22,040
Greetings, Beautiful Lady Lan.

151
00:12:22,880 --> 00:12:24,400
Raise your head and let me see you.

152
00:12:27,760 --> 00:12:29,640
(It's the same scent
as on the earlier bamboo slips.)

153
00:12:35,320 --> 00:12:36,720
Such a fair face.

154
00:12:36,960 --> 00:12:38,240
If not for your hair being tied up,

155
00:12:38,360 --> 00:12:39,880
I'd have taken you for a woman.

156
00:12:43,040 --> 00:12:44,000
Greetings, Beautiful Lady Lan.

157
00:12:46,600 --> 00:12:48,000
No such formalities needed,
Diviner Song.

158
00:12:50,200 --> 00:12:51,280
This attendant of yours

159
00:12:51,920 --> 00:12:53,240
is rather interesting.

160
00:13:13,920 --> 00:13:15,080
Xiuxiu, go.

161
00:13:21,920 --> 00:13:24,440
Don't you think there's something

162
00:13:24,600 --> 00:13:25,400
off about Beautiful Lady Lan?

163
00:13:27,880 --> 00:13:29,120
I caught the same scent on her

164
00:13:29,200 --> 00:13:30,680
as on that bamboo slip

165
00:13:30,800 --> 00:13:31,640
bearing traces of shamanic arts.

166
00:13:33,840 --> 00:13:36,080
But Beautiful Lady Lan
is inside the palace.

167
00:13:36,560 --> 00:13:37,880
Neither of us can
easily investigate her.

168
00:13:38,240 --> 00:13:39,520
Why investigate her at all?

169
00:13:40,400 --> 00:13:41,680
If all these strange incidents

170
00:13:41,680 --> 00:13:43,160
were caused by Beautiful Lady Lan,

171
00:13:43,480 --> 00:13:44,200
she must have come to the palace

172
00:13:44,240 --> 00:13:45,480
with an even bigger plot in mind.

173
00:13:46,480 --> 00:13:47,560
Shouldn't we investigate?

174
00:13:48,600 --> 00:13:50,240
Don't you want to become Grand Shaman?

175
00:13:50,440 --> 00:13:51,520
If you offend Beautiful Lady Lan,

176
00:13:51,720 --> 00:13:52,680
offend the King,

177
00:13:52,960 --> 00:13:54,240
how will you become Grand Shaman then?

178
00:13:54,800 --> 00:13:56,440
If you're worried about me, just say so.

179
00:13:56,480 --> 00:13:58,200
Stop making excuses, will you?

180
00:13:59,560 --> 00:14:00,240
Fine.

181
00:14:00,880 --> 00:14:02,400
Since you know I'm worried,

182
00:14:02,640 --> 00:14:03,680
why do you still have to meddle?

183
00:14:04,000 --> 00:14:05,080
How can I not?

184
00:14:05,360 --> 00:14:06,160
If I told you

185
00:14:06,280 --> 00:14:07,920
this city will be destroyed in 23 days,

186
00:14:08,000 --> 00:14:08,760
would you believe me?

187
00:14:11,480 --> 00:14:12,640
The city will be destroyed?

188
00:14:13,480 --> 00:14:14,320
I don't believe it.

189
00:14:14,520 --> 00:14:15,320
Song Ziyuan,

190
00:14:15,600 --> 00:14:17,360
you clearly have memories
of your previous life.

191
00:14:17,520 --> 00:14:18,800
Why won't you admit it?

192
00:14:21,920 --> 00:14:22,840
Just now I said

193
00:14:23,000 --> 00:14:24,080
in 23 days,

194
00:14:24,200 --> 00:14:25,640
Jinan City will be destroyed.

195
00:14:25,800 --> 00:14:27,640
Anyone else would never believe it.

196
00:14:28,520 --> 00:14:30,360
But you looked
as if you knew it was coming,

197
00:14:30,560 --> 00:14:31,840
without a trace of surprise.

198
00:14:32,040 --> 00:14:32,720
- You...
- Let's go home.

199
00:14:34,120 --> 00:14:35,680
Why are you
pretending not to hear me again?

200
00:14:36,480 --> 00:14:37,800
Did you think
that would hide it from me?

201
00:14:37,920 --> 00:14:38,920
(I'll beat you to death!)

202
00:14:38,920 --> 00:14:40,000
(There's a fight over there.)

203
00:14:44,360 --> 00:14:46,360
Stop! Stop hitting me!

204
00:14:46,840 --> 00:14:48,680
If you hadn't gone to the physician
behind my back,

205
00:14:49,520 --> 00:14:50,480
(Zhao Qing)
I'd never have known

206
00:14:50,680 --> 00:14:52,560
the child in your belly isn't mine!

207
00:14:52,640 --> 00:14:53,640
It is your child!

208
00:14:53,680 --> 00:14:55,320
How could it not be yours?

209
00:14:56,320 --> 00:14:57,280
It's mine?

210
00:15:03,220 --> 00:15:04,480
(Xia Ying)

211
00:15:04,480 --> 00:15:05,560
Mind your own business, will you?

212
00:15:06,360 --> 00:15:07,680
Careful, or I'll beat you both!

213
00:15:08,280 --> 00:15:10,960
You're beating your pregnant wife
in the street!

214
00:15:11,240 --> 00:15:13,280
Do you think Chu State has no laws?

215
00:15:16,720 --> 00:15:23,460
♪Night rain falls in the courtyard,
shining on mortal partings♪

216
00:15:23,880 --> 00:15:30,540
♪Strangers meet again,
past lives gleam in endless hues♪

217
00:15:30,910 --> 00:15:34,240
♪A sharp arrow pierces memory♪

218
00:15:34,410 --> 00:15:37,610
♪Longing spreads like dye♪

219
00:15:37,930 --> 00:15:44,590
♪Beaded curtains
keep love and hate apart♪

220
00:15:45,020 --> 00:15:51,670
♪Through boundless grief,
love remains hard to sever♪

221
00:15:51,960 --> 00:15:58,330
♪A past bond, a parting dream;
when cold ends, purest joy remains♪

222
00:15:58,500 --> 00:16:01,930
♪That year,
pear blossoms, verse, and laughter♪

223
00:16:02,190 --> 00:16:05,400
♪One night, snow fell in wild flurries♪

224
00:16:05,440 --> 00:16:12,320
♪All perfection in this world
hides regret♪

225
00:16:12,680 --> 00:16:16,210
♪A drop of heart's blood seals love♪

226
00:16:16,360 --> 00:16:19,930
♪No more longing enters dreams♪

227
00:16:20,320 --> 00:16:26,770
♪When all turns to mist,
may you and I be safe forever♪

228
00:16:55,670 --> 00:17:02,340
♪Through boundless grief,
love remains hard to sever♪

229
00:17:02,600 --> 00:17:08,890
♪A past bond, a parting dream;
when cold ends, purest joy remains♪
